 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Lovely. Which month and which country are we talking about? Roughly how much are we talking about for everything? Strawberries are great for spring, and cheese comes down hard. Which country you in can affect the prices a lot. Music is great, especially if you both like the same tunes. An audio player is cheap but batteries don't last, so think about power options. Then leave off the music and just ask her which park she wants to visit each day, waking up before it gets too hot. That way the surprise lasts as long as the flowers last.",
